          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omukama Rehobbowamu, nukwo kukora engabu ez'omulinga yaigarra omu kiikaro kyazo, yazikwasa bakuru b'abalinzi, abaalindaga omulyango gw'enju y'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kasumi, omukama obu yabaga naataaha omunju ya MUKAMA, abalinzi baazihimbaga, baigarra omu kisiika eki zaayahurwamuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
